   "page": 5,
   "fixture": true,
   "description": "The output being measured drives a test point loaded by CL to ground and by RL to a node that S1 can connect to VCC and S2 to ground. For tpd and tt both switches are open and RL carries no current; for enable and disable times one switch is closed, chosen by the output level being entered or left, per the load circuit settings table.",
